# playpick cell: mode=clear spec=druid:feral style=good size=25
# difficulty=heroic view=820x1180,touch save=fresh.
#
# Checked sessions.jsonl first: druid:feral has eight prior readings across
# every other mode (battleground, walk, raid, daily) and five styles (auto,
# idle, mash, dodge, flee) but never once under `good` -- this is the first
# good-style reading this job has ever taken on this class, in any mode. The
# only prior mode=clear reading on this class was idle/10-normal/fresh/
# 1280x800 (2026-09-27), so this is also the first time the class has been
# walked through a real heroic 25-player evening rather than a normal 10-man
# one, and the first time on a 820x1180 portrait touch viewport in this mode.
#
# A fresh save locks 25-heroic, so #b=marrow&s=25&h=1 unlocks the tier the
# same way every other 25-heroic clear/walk script in this ledger does since
# the 2026-09-26 driver-lesson, then backs out to a real RAID -> WALK IN at
# the door rather than the invite's single-fight "visiting" framing.
#
# direction.md's #6 (THE VIGIL stalls any evening at one fixed point) and #3
# (a travel-mode wipe's PULL AGAIN never revives the party) are both already
# confirmed across many specs/styles/saves/viewports, so this cell's news
# value is the good-style/feral-druid combination and the portrait-touch
# viewport -- watching for either known shape anyway, since no feral druid
# has run a real rotation through a genuine heroic evening yet.
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
tap back
tap raid
shot raid-setup
tap next
tap class:druid:feral
shot class-selected
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start
targets
ui
evening good 260 10
shot end
state
says
bill
